From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nadelacruz-00 <323917690+nadelacruz-00@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:21:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "drm/msm/a6xx_gmu: erhai: always cold-boot the GMU on
 a8xx (fix intermittent runtime-resume hang)"

This reverts commit 992da703edcd.

The runtime-resume hangs the original blamed on warm boot came from the
mis-sized device tree windows (the RSCC at gpu+0x50000 outside the GPU
node's 0x40000 kgsl_3d0_reg_memory window, and the GX GDSC left unbound by
9c9eefdef1 because the gxclkctl node mapped only 4 KiB), which kept the GMU
from being properly power collapsed; with the windows fixed a8xx again
picks warm or cold boot from CX_MISC_TCM_RET_CNTL like a7xx.

Tested on a OnePlus Pad 3 (SM8750): <to be filled after the g0 rung>

Signed-off-by: nadelacruz-00 <323917690+nadelacruz-00@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c | 18 +-----------------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
index 2c7a8f606d0..273baf303a9 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
@@ -1368,23 +1368,7 @@ int a6xx_gmu_resume(struct a6xx_gpu *a6xx_gpu)
 	enable_irq(gmu->gmu_irq);
 
 	/* Check to see if we are doing a cold or warm boot */
-	if (adreno_is_a8xx(adreno_gpu)) {
-		/*
-		 * erhai: always cold-boot the GMU on a8xx. The warm-boot path
-		 * (TCM_RET_CNTL==1 -> skip the firmware reload) assumes the GMU
-		 * firmware is still resident in DTCM across the runtime-PM
-		 * suspend, but the driver only programs TCM retention for a7xx
-		 * (a6xx_gmu_fw_start), so on a8xx the DTCM is not guaranteed to
-		 * survive and the warm boot occasionally runs garbage -> the CM3
-		 * never sets FW_INIT_RESULT and a6xx_gmu_start times out
-		 * ("GMU firmware initialization timed out" + GMU OOB GPU_SET
-		 * storm -> hangcheck -> frozen display; first spontaneous hang
-		 * with the GPU at runtime-PM auto, 2026-09-12). Reloading the
-		 * firmware on every resume is deterministic and removes the
-		 * DTCM-retention dependence entirely.
-		 */
-		status = GMU_COLD_BOOT;
-	} else if (adreno_is_a7xx(adreno_gpu)) {
+	if (adreno_is_a7xx(adreno_gpu) || adreno_is_a8xx(adreno_gpu)) {
 		status = a6xx_cx_misc_read(a6xx_gpu, REG_A7XX_CX_MISC_TCM_RET_CNTL) == 1 ?
 			GMU_WARM_BOOT : GMU_COLD_BOOT;
 	} else if (gmu->legacy) {
